{% comment %}
  Mëva — Order confirmation email v3 (Shopify: Settings → Notifications → Order confirmation)
  v3 (24 Nov 2026, Claude review of Sara's v2):
  - "mid-January" → "January" (matches site, checkout and ads).
  - Timeline no longer promises what you will feel or "what's happening in your body"
    (implied health claims). Only GB-register claim wording is used.
  - "48% of your daily intake" → "48% of the Nutrient Reference Value (NRV)".
  - Guarantee matches the site's terms (45 days from delivery).
  - Adds: variant (pack) name, discounts, subtotal, delivery address, cancellation rights,
    order status link, company details.
  - Pack count now multiplies by quantity (2 × "3 jars" = 6 jars).
  IMAGE SPACES ARE EMPTY PLACEHOLDERS — Sara adds the final images.
{% endcomment %}
{% assign jars = 0 %}
{% for line in line_items %}
  {% assign per = 1 %}
  {% if line.variant.title contains '5' %}{% assign per = 5 %}
  {% elsif line.variant.title contains '3' %}{% assign per = 3 %}
  {% elsif line.variant.title contains '2' %}{% assign per = 2 %}
  {% endif %}
  {% assign add = per | times: line.quantity %}
  {% assign jars = jars | plus: add %}
{% endfor %}
{% if jars < 1 %}{% assign jars = 1 %}{% endif %}
{% assign supply_days = jars | times: 30 %}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Your Mëva order is confirmed</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#FFFFFF;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:560px;width:100%;">

  <!-- Logo -->
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding-bottom:14px;">
    <span style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A1A1A;letter-spacing:1px;">mëva</span>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Confirmed -->
  <tr><td align="center">
    <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:30px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A1A1A;">Your order is confirmed.</div>
    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#666666;margin:8px 0 0;">
      Thank you{% if customer.first_name %}, {{ customer.first_name }}{% endif %}. Your order is freshly made in our first batch and ships in January.
      We'll email you the tracking link the day it leaves our warehouse.
    </p>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- IMAGE SPACE: HERO -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:20px;">
    <div style="background:#F4E9E2;border:2px dashed #C9A18F;border-radius:10px;height:320px;text-align:center;">
      <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#A9806A;padding-top:150px;">IMAGE SPACE — HERO</div>
    </div>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Welcome -->
  <tr><td align="center" style="padding-top:24px;">
    <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:23px;color:#1A1A1A;">Welcome to Mëva</div>
    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;line-height:20px;color:#555555;margin:8px 0 0;">
      Magnesium the simple way: two berry gummies a day, 180mg of magnesium.
      {{ jars }} jar{% if jars > 1 %}s{% endif %} = {{ supply_days }} days.
    </p>
    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#888888;margin:14px 0 0;">
      Your order number is {{ name }}.
    </p>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Order details -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:16px;">
    <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A1A1A;">Order details</div>
    {% for line in line_items %}
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:10px;">
      <tr>
        <td width="72" valign="top">
          <div style="width:64px;height:64px;background:#F4E9E2;border:2px dashed #C9A18F;border-radius:8px;text-align:center;">
            <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#A9806A;padding-top:26px;">IMAGE</div>
          </div>
        </td>
        <td valign="top" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#1A1A1A;padding-left:12px;">
          {{ line.product.title | default: line.title }}{% if line.variant.title != blank and line.variant.title != 'Default Title' %} · {{ line.variant.title }}{% endif %}<br>
          <span style="color:#666666;">Quantity: {{ line.quantity }}</span>
        </td>
        <td valign="top" align="right" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#1A1A1A;">
          {% if line.original_line_price > line.final_line_price %}<span style="color:#999999;text-decoration:line-through;">{{ line.original_line_price | money }}</span><br>{% endif %}{{ line.final_line_price | money }}
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    {% endfor %}
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666666;">Subtotal</td>
        <td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666666;">{{ subtotal_price | money }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% if discounts_amount > 0 %}
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666666;">Discount</td>
        <td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666666;">-{{ discounts_amount | money }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endif %}
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666666;">Delivery · pre-order, ships in January (tracked UK delivery)</td>
        <td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#666666;">{% if shipping_price == 0 %}Free{% else %}{{ shipping_price | money }}{% endif %}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A1A1A;padding-top:4px;">Total</td>
        <td align="right" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;color:#1A1A1A;padding-top:4px;">{{ total_price | money }}</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    {% if shipping_address %}
    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;line-height:18px;color:#666666;margin:14px 0 0;">
      <strong style="color:#1A1A1A;">Delivering to</strong><br>
      {{ shipping_address.name }}<br>{{ shipping_address.address1 }}{% if shipping_address.address2 != blank %}, {{ shipping_address.address2 }}{% endif %}<br>
      {{ shipping_address.city }} {{ shipping_address.zip }}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
    <div style="padding-top:16px;">
      <a href="{{ order_status_url }}" style="display:inline-block;background:#3D0F27;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;padding:11px 26px;border-radius:8px;">View your order →</a>
    </div>
  </td></tr>

  <tr><td style="border-bottom:1px solid #E5E5E5;padding-top:20px;"></td></tr>

  <!-- VIDEO SPACE -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:20px;">
    <div style="background:#111111;border-radius:6px;height:300px;text-align:center;">
      <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#777777;padding-top:140px;">VIDEO / GIF SPACE</div>
    </div>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Routine (no promised effects) -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:26px;">
    <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#D96C4A;">WHEN YOUR JARS ARRIVE</div>
    <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:22px;color:#1A1A1A;margin-top:5px;">Your Mëva routine:</div>

    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <tr>
        <td width="30" valign="top"><span style="font-size:19px;color:#B03A6B;">✱</span></td>
        <td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;line-height:20px;color:#555555;padding-bottom:16px;">
          <strong style="color:#1A1A1A;">Day 1</strong><br>
          Two gummies a day, at the same time each day. Chew, no water needed.
          Pick a moment you never miss: with breakfast, or with your evening tea.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td width="30" valign="top"><span style="font-size:19px;color:#B03A6B;">✱</span></td>
        <td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;line-height:20px;color:#555555;padding-bottom:16px;">
          <strong style="color:#1A1A1A;">{% if jars == 1 %}Weeks 2–3{% else %}The first month{% endif %}</strong><br>
          Keep the routine going. Magnesium contributes to the reduction of tiredness and fatigue
          and to normal psychological function. Everyone is different, so we'll check in with you by email along the way.
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td width="30" valign="top"><span style="font-size:19px;color:#B03A6B;">✱</span></td>
        <td style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;line-height:20px;color:#555555;">
          <strong style="color:#1A1A1A;">{% if jars == 1 %}Day 30: end of your jar{% else %}End of jar 1{% endif %}</strong><br>
          Finish your first jar, then decide whether Mëva has earned a place in your day.
          {% if jars > 1 %}Your other {{ jars | minus: 1 }} jar{% if jars > 2 %}s keep{% else %} keeps{% endif %} you going for {{ supply_days | minus: 30 }} more days.{% endif %}
          Not for you? Our first-jar guarantee has you covered.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <div style="text-align:center;padding-top:20px;">
      <a href="https://trymeva.co/products/meva-magnesium-gummies" style="display:inline-block;background:#D96C4A;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 34px;border-radius:8px;">Read up →</a>
    </div>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Claims panel (GB register wording) -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:26px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FBEEE7;border-radius:12px;">
      <tr><td style="padding:20px 22px;">
        <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:17px;color:#1A1A1A;">Magnesium contributes to:</div>
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:12px;">
          <tr><td style="padding-bottom:8px;"><span style="font-size:15px;color:#B03A6B;">✱</span>&nbsp; <span style="display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid #3D0F27;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#3D0F27;background:#FFFFFF;">The reduction of tiredness and fatigue</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td style="padding-bottom:8px;"><span style="font-size:15px;color:#B03A6B;">✱</span>&nbsp; <span style="display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid #3D0F27;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#3D0F27;background:#FFFFFF;">Normal psychological function</span></td></tr>
          <tr><td><span style="font-size:15px;color:#B03A6B;">✱</span>&nbsp; <span style="display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid #3D0F27;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#3D0F27;background:#FFFFFF;">Normal muscle function</span></td></tr>
        </table>
        <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#555555;margin:12px 0 0;">
          180mg magnesium per 2 gummies = 48% of the Nutrient Reference Value (NRV).
        </p>
      </td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:26px;">
    <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#D96C4A;">QUESTIONS ANSWERED</div>
    <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:22px;color:#1A1A1A;margin-top:5px;">Here's how it works:</div>
    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.5px;line-height:20px;color:#555555;margin:10px 0 0;">
      Magnesium is a mineral your body uses every day, and it has to come from what you eat
      or from a supplement. Two Mëva gummies give you 180mg of magnesium a day, in a form that's easy to keep up.
    </p>

    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin-top:16px;">
      <tr><td width="30" align="center"><span style="font-size:17px;color:#D96C4A;">✱</span></td><td><span style="display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid #D96C4A;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#8A4B2A;">YOU TAKE 2 GUMMIES</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td align="center" style="color:#D96C4A;">|</td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td width="30" align="center"><span style="font-size:17px;color:#D96C4A;">✱</span></td><td><span style="display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid #D96C4A;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#8A4B2A;">180MG MAGNESIUM</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td align="center" style="color:#D96C4A;">|</td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td width="30" align="center"><span style="font-size:17px;color:#D96C4A;">✱</span></td><td><span style="display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid #D96C4A;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#8A4B2A;">48% OF THE NRV</span></td></tr>
      <tr><td align="center" style="color:#D96C4A;">|</td><td></td></tr>
      <tr><td width="30" align="center"><span style="font-size:17px;color:#D96C4A;">✱</span></td><td><span style="display:inline-block;border:1.5px solid #D96C4A;border-radius:999px;padding:5px 14px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#8A4B2A;">EVERY DAY: THAT'S THE METHOD</span></td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- IMAGE SPACE: GUMMIES -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:24px;">
    <div style="background:#F4E9E2;border:2px dashed #C9A18F;border-radius:10px;height:300px;text-align:center;">
      <div style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#A9806A;padding-top:140px;">IMAGE SPACE — GUMMIES CLOSE-UP</div>
    </div>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Label panel -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:24px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#FBEEE7;border-radius:12px;">
      <tr><td style="padding:20px 22px;">
        <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:17px;color:#1A1A1A;">What you get is exactly what's on the label:</div>
        <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:19px;color:#555555;margin:8px 0 0;">
          180mg of magnesium in every daily serving of two gummies. 60 gummies, 30 days per jar.
          Pectin-based and vegan, made without gelatine. The full ingredient list is printed on every jar.
        </p>
        <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#3D0F27;margin:12px 0 0;">
          <strong>VEGAN</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>GELATINE-FREE</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>NO SUBSCRIPTION</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>FIRST-JAR GUARANTEE</strong>
        </p>
      </td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Guarantee + cancellation -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:22px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#3D0F27;border-radius:12px;">
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 24px;">
        <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:18px;color:#FFFFFF;">Finish your first jar. Not for you? We'll refund it.</div>
        <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11.5px;line-height:17px;color:#E8CFC0;margin:7px 0 0;">
          Email us within 45 days of delivery. First order only, one per household. Full terms: trymeva.co/pages/refunds
        </p>
      </td></tr>
    </table>
    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#666666;margin:12px 0 0;text-align:center;">
      Changed your mind? You can cancel for a full refund any time before your order ships. Just reply to this email.
      After delivery, you also have 14 days to cancel under UK consumer law.
    </p>
  </td></tr>

  <!-- Footer bar -->
  <tr><td style="padding-top:22px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#D96C4A;border-radius:10px;">
      <tr><td align="center" style="padding:16px 18px;">
        <div style="font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;color:#FFFFFF;">All dose. No drama.</div>
        <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;color:#FFE9DF;margin:7px 0 0;">
          TRACKED UK DELIVERY &nbsp;·&nbsp; FIRST-JAR GUARANTEE &nbsp;·&nbsp; SECURE CHECKOUT &nbsp;·&nbsp; INFO@TRYMEVA.CO
        </p>
      </td></tr>
    </table>
    <p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;color:#999999;text-align:center;margin:12px 0 0;">
      Questions? Reply to this email or write to info@trymeva.co.<br>
      Food supplement. Do not exceed the recommended daily intake. Food supplements should not be used as a substitute for a varied, balanced diet and a healthy lifestyle. Keep out of reach of young children.<br>
      Mëva is a trading name of Organo LLC.
    </p>
  </td></tr>

</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
